  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Marian Strangfeld</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-2579 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-education category-events category-monthly-meetings category-news tag-cape-cod tag-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-harwich-port tag-marian-strangfeld tag-the-mad-minnow\" id=\"post-2579\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/finished-demo-painting-by-marian-strangfeld/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"498\" height=\"500\" alt=\"©Marian Strangfeld, Demo painting in progress\" src=\"/media/archive/9b2ebb9ae9038b7145e36443f29e0529d2166bc9e2892973b64ab322c0db9045.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/finished-demo-painting-by-marian-strangfeld/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Finished Demo Painting by Marian Strangfeld</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-03-21T01:04:27-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, March 21, 2017, 1:04 am\">March 21, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>  Dear Guild members, I really enjoyed meeting you all on Saturday. Thanks for being such a lively and supportive audience. You asked very good questions, and kept the conversation <a href=\"/news/finished-demo-painting-by-marian-strangfeld/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-2234 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-education category-events category-monthly-meetings category-news tag-cape-cod tag-marian-strangfeld tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-2234\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/march-guest-artist-marian-strangfeld/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"488\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A painting of sand dunes near the ocean by The Guild of Harwich Artists.\" src=\"/media/archive/fdd88c04af49a1752c3f45540c1b414acdcd8d508978a7be57ef113abe9e3d4c.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/march-guest-artist-marian-strangfeld/\" rel=\"bookmark\">March Guest Artist Marian Strangfeld</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-03-06T23:45:47-05:00\" title=\"Monday, March 6, 2017, 11:45 pm\">March 6, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists announces a free demonstration by artist and teacher Marian Strangfeld on Saturday, March 18, from 2 to 4 PM at the Harwich Community Center at <a href=\"/news/march-guest-artist-marian-strangfeld/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n",
